WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue {
    color: white;
    background-color: #383943A3;
}

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.968
That's annoyingly well put.

00:00:02.968 --> 00:00:06.508
Okay – but can I just say, it's a lot of things at
once.

00:00:06.508 --> 00:00:07.937
It's not just the job.

00:00:07.937 --> 00:00:11.548
I had to tell the five-a-side group I can't do Wednesday
nights anymore.

00:00:11.606 --> 00:00:13.498
I've been doing that for three years, Javi.

00:00:13.498 --> 00:00:15.135
And before you say it – I know.

00:00:15.135 --> 00:00:15.959
It's worth it.

00:00:15.959 --> 00:00:16.668
I know...